sections.content:
Always respect `prefers-reduced-motion`. People usually set it for a reason. Disable transitions and animations when this media query is active.
```css
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
*,
*::before,
*::after {
animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
}
}
```
